<td id="xdx_F05_zgrcNf9Ty7Gc" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 15pt; text-align: right">(1)</td><td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 5pt"/><td id="xdx_F1F_zXqTazg9amt6" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><ix:footnote id="Footnote000227" xml:lang="en-US">The share and per share
                                                                                                                                                                                             information in these financial statements reflects the <span id="xdx_90C_ecustom--DescriptionOfReverseStockSplitsSignificantChangeInSharesIssuedAndOutstanding_c20230821__20230821_zUZ7vtO1Xkl3" title="Reverse share splits"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2023-08-212023-08-21" id="Fact000229" name="SMX:DescriptionOfReverseStockSplitsSignificantChangeInSharesIssuedAndOutstanding">1-for-22</ix:nonNumeric></span>, <span id="xdx_90A_ecustom--DescriptionOfReverseStockSplitsSignificantChangeInSharesIssuedAndOutstanding_c20240715__20240715_zuflMY7xEz39" title="Reverse share splits"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2024-07-152024-07-15" id="Fact000231" name="SMX:DescriptionOfReverseStockSplitsSignificantChangeInSharesIssuedAndOutstanding">1-for-75</ix:nonNumeric></span>, <span id="xdx_908_ecustom--DescriptionOfReverseStockSplitsSignificantChangeInSharesIssuedAndOutstanding_c20250115__20250115__ifrs-full--NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis__ifrs-full--PotentialOrdinaryShareTransactionsMember_zJgpqt6lOksj" title="Reverse share splits"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2025-01-152025-01-15_ifrs-full_PotentialOrdinaryShareTransactionsMember" id="Fact000233" name="SMX:DescriptionOfReverseStockSplitsSignificantChangeInSharesIssuedAndOutstanding">1-for-28.5</ix:nonNumeric></span>
                                                                                                                                                                                             and <span id="xdx_90E_ecustom--DescriptionOfReverseStockSplitsSignificantChangeInSharesIssuedAndOutstanding_c20250616__20250616__ifrs-full--NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis__ifrs-full--PotentialOrdinaryShareTransactionsMember_zEo2mGaxcQ3k" title="Reverse share splits"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2025-06-162025-06-16_ifrs-full_PotentialOrdinaryShareTransactionsMember" id="Fact000235" name="SMX:DescriptionOfReverseStockSplitsSignificantChangeInSharesIssuedAndOutstanding">1-for-4.1</ix:nonNumeric></span>
                                                                                                                                                                                             reverse share splits became effective on August 21, 2023, July 15, 2024, January 15, 2025 and June 16, 2025,
                                                                                                                                                                                             respectively of the Company&#8217;s issued and outstanding Ordinary Shares (the &#8220;Reverse Stock Splits&#8221;). See also Notes
                                                                                                                                                                                             17.4, 1.F, 1.G, and 28.13.</ix:footnote></td>
</tr></table>

