<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify"><b>&#160;</b></p>

<table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%">
  <tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 85%; text-align: center">
    <p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><b>SMX (SECURITY MATTERS) PUBLIC
    LIMITED COMPANY</b></p>
    <p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><b>NOTES TO THE CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL
    STATEMENTS<span style="font-size: 11pt"></span></b></p>
    <p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><b>(US$ in thousands, except share and per share data)</b></p></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 15%; text-align: right"><img src="ex99-1_001.jpg" alt=""/></td></tr>
  </table>
<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify"><b></b></p>

</ix:nonNumeric><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2024-01-01to2024-12-31" escape="true" id="Fact001789" name="ifrs-full:DisclosureOfLeasesExplanatory"><p id="xdx_802_eifrs-full--DisclosureOfLeasesExplanatory_zTUrcaJJLsN3" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -21.25pt"><b>NOTE 14 - <span id="xdx_82F_zP4ErZGkfZ57">LEASES</span>:</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -21.25pt"><b>&#160;</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify">The Group has lease contracts for office facilities
(including a lab) and motor vehicles used in its operations. Leases of office and lab facilities generally have lease terms of <span id="xdx_907_ecustom--LeaseExpiration_dtY_c20240101__20241231__ifrs-full--ClassesOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentAxis__ifrs-full--OfficeEquipmentMember_zviMIaPqqgbg" title="Lease expiration"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2024-01-012024-12-31_ifrs-full_OfficeEquipmentMember" format="ixt-sec:duryear" id="Fact001791" name="SMX:LeaseExpiration">12</ix:nonNumeric></span> years,
motor vehicles generally have lease terms of <span id="xdx_90F_ecustom--LeaseExpiration_dtY_c20240101__20241231__ifrs-full--ClassesOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentAxis__ifrs-full--MotorVehiclesMember_zxmu3kH4Hn6a" title="Lease expiration"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2024-01-012024-12-31_ifrs-full_MotorVehiclesMember" format="ixt-sec:duryear" id="Fact001793" name="SMX:LeaseExpiration">3</ix:nonNumeric></span> years.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2024-01-01to2024-12-31" escape="true" id="Fact001795" name="SMX:DisclosureOfDetailedInformationAboutRightofuseAssetsExplanatory"><p id="xdx_895_ecustom--DisclosureOfDetailedInformationAboutRightofuseAssetsExplanatory_zubsgBdd7RXf" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify">Set out below are the carrying amounts of right-of-use
assets recognized and the movements during the period:</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify">&#160;<span id="xdx_8B8_zHzWTtV5P6a8" style="display: none">SCHEDULE OF RIGHT OF USE ASSETS</span></p>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%">
  <tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: bottom">
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></td><td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; padding-bottom: 1pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></td>
