<td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 0.25in">3.</td><td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify">As of December 31, 2024, the Group has estimated carry forward tax losses of approximately $<span id="xdx_902_eifrs-full--TaxEffectOfTaxLosses_pn3n3_c20240101__20241231_z5gANJ2G3sBj"><ix:nonFraction name="ifrs-full:TaxEffectOfTaxLosses" contextRef="From2024-01-01to2024-12-31" id="Fact002463" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">69,363</ix:nonFraction></span> (2023:
$<span id="xdx_90C_eifrs-full--TaxEffectOfTaxLosses_pn3n3_c20230101__20231231_zXKJm6YTGSwg"><ix:nonFraction name="ifrs-full:TaxEffectOfTaxLosses" contextRef="From2023-01-012023-12-31" id="Fact002464" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">45,095</ix:nonFraction></span>, 2022: $<span id="xdx_907_eifrs-full--TaxEffectOfTaxLosses_pn3n3_c20220101__20221231_z7h3TsC24QTi" title="Carry forward tax losses"><ix:nonFraction name="ifrs-full:TaxEffectOfTaxLosses" contextRef="From2022-01-012022-12-31" id="Fact002466" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">24,106</ix:nonFraction></span>) which may be carried forward and offset against taxable income for an indefinite period in the future. The Group
did not recognize deferred tax assets relating to carry forward losses in the financial statements because their utilization in the foreseeable
future is not probable.</td></tr></table>

</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_819_zAczyG8cgUw" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in">&#160;</p>


